---
title: "State Machine: Shift"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Published : publish
    Published --> OpenForSwap : postForSwap
    OpenForSwap --> Claimed : claim
    Claimed --> Published : approve / reassign
    Claimed --> OpenForSwap : deny
    Published --> Worked : shift ends, attended
    Published --> NoShow : shift ends, absent
    Worked --> [*]
    NoShow --> [*]
